1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:39,000
The Eye of the Midnight Sun set themselves up as the enemy of the Clover Kingdom and worked behind the scenes with the intent of establishing their own sovereign state.

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:46,000
They believed that gathering the items known as magic stones would allow them to be reborn in their true forms, granting them great power.

6
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,000
However, they must still collect three more before this rebirth can occur.

7
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:57,000
One of these stones was in the Underwater Temple, part of a strong magic region where the mana is said to be especially powerful.

8
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Thank you, Yami. I'm counting on you. Oh, and Asta!

