33
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:42,280
Swimsuits?

34
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:43,920
That's right.

35
00:03:44,420 --> 00:03:45,520
Swimsuits, golden boy.

36
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:46,280
Excuse me.

37
00:03:46,500 --> 00:03:48,740
We're taking a trip, heading to the beach.

38
00:03:49,220 --> 00:03:52,780
Noelle here doesn't have a swimsuit, so I offered to help her pick one out.

39
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:56,440
Personally, I thought it would be easier if she just borrowed one of mine.

40
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:57,580
But she declined.

41
00:03:57,580 --> 00:03:59,660
