You expect me to wear that?

43
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:04,560
Oh my, that sounds interesting.

44
00:04:05,260 --> 00:04:07,460
So then all the screaming we heard earlier...

45
00:04:07,460 --> 00:04:10,680
That was when Vanessa started ripping my clothes off without permission!

46
