64
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:53,960
That's a shame.

65
00:04:54,080 --> 00:04:55,520
I'd love a trip to the beach.

66
00:04:55,780 --> 00:04:58,820
Our next mission starts tomorrow, though, so we're all booked up.

67
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:00,660
Oh, that is a shame.

68
00:05:01,180 --> 00:05:02,940
My Prince of Professions is here!

69
00:05:02,960 --> 00:05:04,860
I wanted to see you in a swimsuit, too, Noelle.

70
00:05:05,420 --> 00:05:07,940
My darling has never seen me in a swimsuit before!

71
00:05:08,060 --> 00:05:09,220
I wonder what he'll say!

72
00:05:09,220 --> 00:05:16,000
It's too much!

73
00:05:16,220 --> 00:05:17,660
I can't handle the sexiness.

74
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:19,080
You're...

75
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:20,740
delicious.

76
00:05:22,020 --> 00:05:23,440
You think so?

77
00:05:25,060 --> 00:05:26,260
Keep me right up!

78
00:05:26,340 --> 00:05:26,940
I'm ready!

79
