92
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:56,420
I'm not worried about the cost.

93
00:05:56,780 --> 00:05:58,880
And it has a certain charm, but...

94
00:05:58,880 --> 00:05:59,540
I don't know.

95
00:06:00,200 --> 00:06:02,140
There's still a lot of skin showing.

96
00:06:02,580 --> 00:06:04,460
And does it really have to be that shiny?

97
00:06:05,640 --> 00:06:08,520
Wear this to the beach, and you're sure to have all eyes on you.

98
