I figured you would have made it your life's mission to visit any place where you were guaranteed to find a bunch of babes in bikinis.

143
00:08:24,700 --> 00:08:25,000
Huh.

144
00:08:25,420 --> 00:08:29,320
I've always found half the pleasure of something lies in the anticipation of it.

145
00:08:29,940 --> 00:08:31,720
I've long anticipated this.

146
00:08:32,220 --> 00:08:33,940
Yes, Rockway, here I come!

147
00:08:34,380 --> 00:08:36,200
It won't be long now, lovely ladies!

148
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:40,540
Wait, where's that person who's always blowing smoke and making that growling noise?

149
00:08:40,900 --> 00:08:42,200
