150
00:08:42,560 --> 00:08:42,780
Huh?

151
00:08:46,880 --> 00:08:50,060
That was actually Grey transformed this whole time?

152
00:08:53,260 --> 00:08:56,060
And if that's Grey, what happened to the real Gordon?

153
00:08:56,820 --> 00:08:57,620
Hey, everyone.

154
