172
00:09:37,880 --> 00:09:39,800
I never knew it was that big!

173
00:09:40,140 --> 00:09:42,340
It's more incredible than I ever imagined.

174
00:09:42,340 --> 00:09:45,060
It's the ocean!

175
00:09:45,060 --> 00:10:00,500
Wow, we're really here!

176
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:01,200
The ocean!

177
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:03,420
And it's freaking enormous!

178
00:10:04,300 --> 00:10:05,720
This is awesome!

179
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:07,240
So awesome!

180
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:10,460
I wish you and the kids back home could see this!

181
00:10:10,780 --> 00:10:11,380
Um, hello!

182
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:14,840
And I've definitely got to bring Sister Lily here someday.

183
00:10:15,260 --> 00:10:16,800
What am I, tub liver?!

184
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:21,180
Isn't the sunset beautiful, Rasta?

185
00:10:21,180 --> 00:10:21,920
Indeed.

186
00:10:22,920 --> 00:10:24,100
It certainly is.

187
00:10:24,180 --> 00:10:25,200
But, Sister...

188
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:27,720
It's still not as beautiful as you.

189
00:10:28,460 --> 00:10:31,720
I am the Wizard King now, so please, Sister Lily.

190
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:33,060
Mew?

191
00:10:35,860 --> 00:10:37,580
Say that you'll marry me!

192
00:10:40,580 --> 00:10:41,500
Of course!

193
00:10:42,460 --> 00:10:44,220
I can just see it now!

194
00:10:44,560 --> 00:10:46,100
Oh yeah, it's gonna be perfect!

195
00:10:46,100 --> 00:10:48,200
What's that goofy look on his face for?

196
00:10:48,980 --> 00:10:52,600
Wait, he's not thinking about that stupid kiss she gave him, is he?

197
00:10:53,420 --> 00:10:55,820
Well, if he is, he should knock it off already.

198
00:10:57,420 --> 00:10:58,600
Not that I care.

199
00:10:58,880 --> 00:11:00,600
I don't want to kiss him or anything.

200
00:11:04,460 --> 00:11:08,400
Maybe it's time to give that insect a proper eyeful of this new swimsuit.

201
00:11:08,820 --> 00:11:10,520
He better not get the wrong idea, though.

202
00:11:10,620 --> 00:11:12,060
I don't want him to want me.

203
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:15,280
I just want him to see that I'm more appealing than Rebecca.

204
00:11:15,280 --> 00:11:16,700
Yeah, that's all.

205
00:11:20,620 --> 00:11:22,120
No, too embarrassed.

206
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:25,360
But I want him to see me.

207
00:11:26,500 --> 00:11:28,280
Ah, but I'm too embarrassed.

208
00:11:29,040 --> 00:11:29,920
Just do it!

209
00:11:33,700 --> 00:11:35,540
I got a new swimsuit!

210
00:11:35,860 --> 00:11:38,260
Hey, Asta, what do you think?

211
00:11:38,280 --> 00:11:39,500
Check it out!

212
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:42,020
