225
00:12:01,500 --> 00:12:02,840
Well, what do you think?

226
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:04,840
Looks pretty good, right?

227
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:07,460
Actually, that's more or less what you always look like.

228
00:12:07,460 --> 00:12:08,460
Mm-hmm.

229
00:12:08,460 --> 00:12:12,340
What would a virgin street punk like you understand about it anyway?

230
00:12:12,340 --> 00:12:14,120
I'm not a virgin street punk!

231
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:15,460
How about a race?

232
00:12:18,460 --> 00:12:20,460
All right, Magna's on fire!

233
00:12:20,460 --> 00:12:25,880
Will you stop running around like idiot children?

234
00:12:26,880 --> 00:12:27,720
It's done.

235
00:12:28,420 --> 00:12:30,100
Do you like your big brother's sculpture?

236
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:31,880
Yes, it's amazing!

237
00:12:32,700 --> 00:12:33,820
Will you turn me around?

238
00:12:34,260 --> 00:12:35,200
Show me the ocean!

239
00:12:35,420 --> 00:12:36,600
Absolutely, Angel.

240
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:39,520
Well, there it is.

241
00:12:40,040 --> 00:12:40,840
What do you think?

242
00:12:41,220 --> 00:12:42,280
Oh, wow!

243
00:12:42,460 --> 00:12:43,920
It's so beautiful!

244
00:12:43,920 --> 00:12:47,960
Next time, I'll bring you two and we'll splash around in the water together.

245
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:51,800
Ooh, that's really cold.

246
00:12:52,620 --> 00:12:53,760
Hey, Asta's there!

247
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:56,860
When you bring me to the beach, can he come along with us?

248
00:12:57,660 --> 00:13:00,260
So, um, I got a new swimsuit, Asta!

249
00:13:00,560 --> 00:13:02,920
Feel free to turn around and check it out if you want.

250
00:13:03,340 --> 00:13:05,760
Anybody who would tempt Marie must die.

251
00:13:05,980 --> 00:13:06,660
Hey, Asta!

252
00:13:06,660 --> 00:13:08,360
Mirror magic, reflect Ray!

253
00:13:08,360 --> 00:13:16,500
It's so salty!

254
00:13:16,940 --> 00:13:18,060
Right, I can't sweat!

255
00:13:18,280 --> 00:13:18,880
This isn't good!

256
00:13:19,340 --> 00:13:20,100
Come on!

257
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:21,700
Will you look at me already?

258
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:23,000
Cash!

259
00:13:25,300 --> 00:13:26,680
Oh, yeah!

260
00:13:27,500 --> 00:13:29,980
So many bathing suit beauties to choose from!

261
00:13:30,300 --> 00:13:31,000
So many!

262
00:13:31,700 --> 00:13:33,660
It's time to get flirty!

263
00:13:33,660 --> 00:13:35,980
All right, Gray, transform into me!

264
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:37,220
Let's go!

265
00:13:37,220 --> 00:13:39,880
Now there's twice the finral to go around!

266
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:41,420
Okay, here's the plan!

267
00:13:41,680 --> 00:13:44,660
We're sexy twins who use witty banter to lure the ladies in!

268
00:13:44,800 --> 00:13:45,840
Think you can handle it?

269
00:13:46,340 --> 00:13:47,180
